+ *
+ *   ---------------------------------------------
+ *   |           valid log        | invalid log  |
+ *   ---------------------------------------------
+ *   ^                            ^
+ *   |- log->last_checkpoint      |- ctx->pos
+ *   |- log->last_cp_seq          |- ctx->seq
